#lang rmn/v2
(map
  ("type" "SoftwareMissionExecutionLaw")
  ("version" 7)
  ("provider" "one sovereign software mission execution settlement")
  ("precondition" "One signed A2A 1.0 Message carries exactly one canonical RMN/CBOR SoftwareMissionExecutionRequest addressed to this settlement. It names an immutable source revision or admitted territory, readable lanes, required provider capabilities, consideration policy, and either a read-only inquiry product or writable lanes with executable customer acceptance and proposal-only authority.")
  ("operation" "Recall trajectories through the trajectory-memory cell, materialize an immutable admitted source, repeatedly procure priced inference transitions from the capability market, execute each admitted observation or mutation in an isolated workspace, feed observations and refusals into the next bid, and stop only on a completed inquiry work product, verified executable acceptance, customer cancellation, or an unchanged repeated-transition obstruction. A writable mission validates protected acceptance through the protected-acceptance cell and returns a receiver-bound proposal; an inquiry returns native text grounded through the same repository tools. A2A carries coordination; RMN owns meaning; deterministic CBOR and RFC 6920 ni own identity.")
  ("postcondition" "Every request, source revision, selected offer, provider settlement, tool transition, inquiry product, verification, acceptance, proposal, refusal, obstruction, route observation, and trajectory receipt has typed identity and append-only witness history. Provider refusal preserves durable demand and changes subsequent market pressure; process lifetime and elapsed wall time do not define completion.")
  ("refusal" "Refuse noncanonical bytes, a foreign operation, incomplete context, unsafe tools, source drift, provider mutation of customer territory, provider-authored acceptance for a writable mission, or authority outside the admitted lanes.")
  ("invariants" ("immutable-source-revision" "append-only-trajectory" "market-contact-per-transition" "fractional-provider-authored-consideration" "refusal-is-observation" "unchanged-transition-is-obstruction" "no-wall-clock-completion-law" "no-customer-package-import" "no-direct-json-semantic-path" "provider-proposal-is-not-customer-acceptance" "protected-acceptance-is-method-independent")))
